  <div class="RichTextStoryBody RichTextBody">
    <p>The city council passed next year's budget early Tuesday after a debate that ran past midnight.</p>
    <p>The plan adds money for buses and parks, and keeps property taxes at this year's level.</p>
    <h2>What changes</h2>
    <p>Bus routes will run every ten minutes during the day, starting in March, the council said.</p>
    <p>Two new parks are planned, one by the river and one next to the new library downtown.</p>
